Z||000002||Master_Sushi||11-08-2001||10:35 PM||||Having the auto dosen't help much. You wont lose to "everything", just most things <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. The 84 autos were the slowest fiero made. They didn't have a TC in the trannie, that kills a top speed. Skylarks had the same engine in 83 as fieros, maybe they were carbed though? I'd hope you can take a skylark. If it was a stick it would be close though.||||reg||12
Z||000003||BlackStang95||11-08-2001||10:41 PM||||the 84 SE's with stick got 0-60 in 10.9 seconds, no telling how slow your old slushbox coupe is.  If you want to race look into an engine swap.  My moneys on the skylark, but you might have a chance if he was the 4 cyilnder, they offered a 4 and a 6.  If its a stick itll beat you regardless.  <p>[This message has been edited by BlackStang95 (edited 11-08-2001).]||||reg||1
